    "Cost": 11407681,
    "UIName": "Blood Reaper 1",
    "Id": "mechdef_blood_reaper_BRR-1",
    "Name": "Blood Reaper 1",
    "Details": "The Blood Reaper was built around a pair of ATM-6 Launchers, one per torso, which provided it with flexible multirange firepower. At long range they were supported by a hard-hitting ER PPC in each arm, while a pair of Heavy Medium Lasers offered enhanced close-range punch. A three ton ammo bay for each ATM launcher allowed the MechWarrior to carry two tons of each of three of the ATM missile types, ensuring maximum tactical flexibility in the field. Sharing a similar reverse-canted leg, energy weapon arm and missile launcher torso layout as the iconic Timber Wolf, the Blood Reaper was built on an Endo Steel frame and uses an XL engine to save weight for a heavy weapon and armor load. Slower than most front-line OmniMechs, the Blood Reaper featured a 120 meter jump capacity to help overcome this. Eighteen Double Heat Sinks provided the design adequate endurance.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_bloodreaper"
  },
